                    <p>今晚 21 点起，京东自营 <strong>AirPods 5</strong> 实测开启<strong>全国国补，</strong>国补 15% 后 PLUS 仅需 755 元起破冰新低。</p><p>京东 PLUS 目前可领 100、125 元 AirPods 5 加补券，180 元 AirPods Pro 3 加补券：<a href="https://u.jd.com/51riZBc" target="_blank"><strong>点此领券</strong></a>。</p><p>京东 11.11 红包至高 26888 元无门槛可用，每天可抽一次：<a href="https://u.jd.com/5Ogm3ry" target="_blank"><strong>点此抽取</strong></a>。</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/5OrCcde" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/508991/23/5637/15808/6aa1af6bF62a0b555/00833203207564db.jpg" title="苹果 AirPods 5 全国国补开启：京东自营 999 → 755 元，支持主动降噪" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name"> Apple AirPods 5</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 支持主动降噪</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">国补后 755 元起</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/51rMPid" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/510534/13/11187/16012/6aa1b021F5cb12594/0083320320765073.jpg" title="苹果 AirPods 5 全国国补开启：京东自营 999 → 755 元，支持主动降噪" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name"> Apple AirPods 5</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> 搭配无线充电盒 增强续航</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">国补后 861 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p>如果有哪个地区的小伙伴发现本地无国补，可在评论区留言哦。</p><p>AirPods Pro 3 目前依旧仅支持<strong>广东、江苏、北京、湖南、吉林、湖北、河北、云南、四川、大连</strong>政府补贴，国补后仅需 1121 元破冰新低：</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/51rCHQj" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="820" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1